Delivered behavior:
- AddTaxAiPersistence validates configuration, registers the SQL Server context,
  and wires every Tenancy persistence port without adding EF Core to the portal.
- SqlConnectionStringGuard refuses an absent string, optional encryption, or
  disabled certificate validation with fixed diagnostics that echo no secret.
- GuidOpaqueIdentifierSource creates non-empty opaque identifiers without
  deriving them from caller or taxpayer content.
- DevelopmentFixtureSeeder writes one idempotent, deterministic, obviously
  synthetic review fixture in one transaction. It seeds no user, membership,
  session, credential, contact field, government identifier, or nine-digit run.
- No schema creation, migration-at-startup, timer, hosted service, scheduler, or
  other background mutation path was added.

